type: software
title: "Arwad: R, compiled"
abstract: "Arwad is a statistical programming language that keeps R's syntax and package ecosystem and compiles numerical work to native code through the Goose systems language, with deterministic, garbage-collection-free memory and results equivalent to GNU R."
